1
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:05,620
…And I promise you that our forces

2
00:00:05,620 --> 00:00:07,820
are maintaining a firm upper hand

3
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:10,820
against this false "Restoration" -

4
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:14,060
thanks in part to the support of our newfound allies

5
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:16,020
in the Taurian Concordat.

6
00:00:16,580 --> 00:00:18,940
Just today, those allies -

7
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:22,420
led by the heroic Commodore Samuel Ostergaard -

8
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:26,020
liberated my own daughter, Victoria,

9
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:27,980
from insurgent captivity.

10
00:00:28,380 --> 00:00:30,820
And though the fight was hard,

11
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:33,020
our new friends won the day

12
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:35,020
through the strength of their courage

13
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:38,020
and the virtue of their purpose.

14
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:42,340
Soon, we will end this war.

15
00:00:43,260 --> 00:00:46,740
And when we do, we will turn our attention back

16
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:48,740
to the expansion of our industries -

17
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:52,020
and the betterment of our people.

18
00:00:52,380 --> 00:00:54,780
Long live the Taurian Concordat,

19
00:00:54,900 --> 00:00:57,420
and long live the Aurigan Directorate!

